% Draft 10, rebuilt around the churn result from docs/revision/paper-v2/outline-draft10.md (draft 9: outline.md).
% Evaluation-2 numbers enter only through \site{} (sites.json) inside % BEGIN-EV2 ... % END-EV2 regions; evaluation-1
