the materiality margin of −0.05. With the primary winners, the only market t interval of a mean
change that excludes zero is that of B3 minus R3 at 0.05 ([−0.282, −0.003]); with the all-frozen
winners the three intervals at 0.05 exclude zero and none at 0.03 does. With the all-frozen winners,
